## 4. Service Registration

### Registering Background Services

**In Program.cs**:
```csharp
// Register as hosted services
builder.Services.AddHostedService<KafkaConsumerService>();
builder.Services.AddHostedService<MaritimeDataETLService>();
builder.Services.AddHostedService<MaritimeStreamingProcessor>();
builder.Services.AddHostedService<DataQualityService>();
