- Real-time data ingestion
- Scheduled tasks
- Background operations
- Scalable architecture

**Key Takeaway**: Background services enable long-running, asynchronous processing independent of HTTP requests. MaritimeIQ uses BackgroundService for Kafka consumers, data pipelines, and streaming processors, providing real-time data processing and scheduled operations.

